{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_589","type":"reasoning","text":"Everything is consistent. One remaining question: should I register the E01 docs in scripts/repository-artifacts.json retainedFiles? The acceptance record's continuation says to do that in a closeout change set. The task's targetScope does not include scripts/repository-artifacts.json. Adding it would be scope creep, and I noted it in `continuation`. Also `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-acceptance.json` etc. would be flagged by repo:artifacts:check as untracked reviewed-directory paths... but that check requires git and can't run. It's documented as notMeasured. Fine.\n\nLet me also double-check the diff of scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs is sane, and confirm no unintended product changes. Also verify no stray files added to tracked paths beyond target scope. The find earlier showed exactly 12 files changed (targetScope 10 + 2 artifacts). Good.\n\nLet me do a final sanity check on the fixture file validity (JSON parses) and confirm the reference test file wasn't accidentally copied into tests/unit (only in .rsi/ref). Also confirm .rsi untouched TASK.json.\n\nOne more: the acceptance `rawEvidence` hashes reference the evidence directory; those were rebuilt before the final build. Good.\n\nLet me quickly view the final report.md reliability section to confirm quality."}}
